---
// Component: ProcessSteps.astro for Computers Gold Coast
---
<section class="py-20 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/50 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/50">
        Transparent Workflow
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-3 tracking-tight uppercase">
        How Installation Works
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
        From first enquiry to final handover across the Gold Coast: transparent, reliable, and zero fuss.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Steps Process Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="glass-box p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between relative shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-black text-xl mb-5">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Tell Us About Your Property</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Property type, camera goals, storeys, access, and existing equipment on the Gold Coast. Share your address or photos for an immediate estimate.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
          // FAST 15-MIN QUOTE
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="glass-box p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between relative shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-600/10 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-black text-xl mb-5">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Assessment &amp; Itemised Quote</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Confirm blind spots, cable routes, storage needs, and written inclusions. You receive a guaranteed fixed-price written proposal with zero sales pressure.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
          // 100% FIXED PRICE
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="glass-box p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between relative shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-600/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-black text-xl mb-5">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Professional Installation</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Mount, cable, configure, test, and clean up. Our licensed technicians arrive with all commercial tooling and pure-copper UV Cat6 lines.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
          // TIDY IN-ROOF ROUTING
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="glass-box p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between relative shadow-lg">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-purple-600/10 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-black text-xl mb-5">
            04
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Handover &amp; Support</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Full walkthrough for the homeowner or staff, all login credentials provided, and smartphones configured. Ongoing local Gold Coast support.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
          // APP TRAINING INCLUDED
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
